================================================================
WHAT TO CHANGE FOR A DIFFERENT PROJECT
================================================================

Only touch these 4 files when your columns are different:

    1. Migration  →  add or rename columns
    2. Model      →  update $fillable list
    3. Controller →  update column names in store() and update()
    4. Views      →  update name="" and {{ $post->column }}

Also rename:
    "Post"   →  your model name
    "posts"  →  your table and route name




